# GitHub Linguist configuration
# Excludes non-essential files from language stats

# === Exclude examples (demo copies, not core code) ===
examples/** linguist-vendored

# === Exclude Gradle wrapper (generated) ===
gradlew linguist-vendored
gradlew.bat linguist-vendored
gradle/** linguist-vendored
*.jar linguist-vendored

# === Exclude docs ===
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation

# === Treat .kts as Kotlin ===
*.kts linguist-language=Kotlin
